/**Function*************************************************************

  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap20 mapper probe.]

  Description [stmap20 tests a shallow early-profile seed rule: before the
  adaptive profile opens, one-inverter middle-slack relief is admitted only
  for shallow candidates that also have material mapper-arrival improvement.]

